Subject: [PATCH] Retain actual RX-event queue DMA before publication

Own the coherent ring in the exposed provider lifetime and reject
late state changes and RX/TX backing overlaps.

---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
@@ -155,6 +155,11 @@
